{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic mini metroidvania Tiny Dangerous Dungeons returns in a completely rebuilt adventure! Guide Timmy the little treasure hunter through a new,  twice as large dungeon than in the original game! Discover new puzzles, new items, new secrets, and battle ferocious new bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NEW GRAPHICS AND MUSIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179810/extras/knives-promo.gif?t=1741277959\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tiny Dangerous Dungeons has been completely rebuilt from scratch with better physics, new colorful graphics, and completely new soundtrack!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPANDED NEW DUNGEON </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179810/extras/mapdoors.png?t=1741277959\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New rooms and secrets have been added to the dungeon, giving the players more reasons to explore and backtrack. The new dungeon is over twice as large than in the original game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEROCIOUS NEW BOSSES </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179810/extras/Boss2v2.gif?t=1741277959\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brand new boss fights have been added to the game, Seek out and fight against 5 new fearsome boss creatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NEW SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179810/extras/mysterious_crystal1.gif?t=1741277959\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secret levels and mysterious new treasures have been hidden in the dungeon! What happens if you collect them all...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Power Pusher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179810/bc8efa65fc67fec9a7c7fdecd4f3552a1f3bbeff.jpg"},{"name":"Knife Thrower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179810/c232a136a442184023ae41e35ebefef93d12580c.jpg"},{"name":"Swift Swimmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179810/cbc1a16e1e685afe4c138ed488a46e56a52bbfe0.jpg"},{"name":"Critter Crusher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179810/f3fdc5e73e547a6f1b742a51a22be0822fafea1f.jpg"},{"name":"Cool Customer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179810/239322e9f6bab55aadf23b91b753fe7bdbbc7bca.jpg"},{"name":"Fiery Footed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179810/abb736d19bfbdf809c0cfa001c92a61c9ff3884f.jpg"},{"name":"Key Keeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179810/c5f700ffb56aa1af7f35fe7ffa808472c1dca36f.jpg"},{"name":"Healthy Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179810/f482e8173fa5c901322cbde17d26d79c5e8dbaab.jpg"},{"name":"Fruit Finder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179810/c77a3f93c8faeba60323b51ba56c9623a54395fb.jpg"},{"name":"Fruit Follower","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179810/005f38dcecb69087252265096b4647de16d13254.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3179810?t=1741277959","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3179810?t=1741277959","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite